<title>FRANCE: Clarins 1996 sales rise 15.8 percent.</title>
<headline>Clarins 1996 sales rise 15.8 percent.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 2,965.3  vs   2,560.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Skincare and cosmetics firm Clarins said in a statement sales rose 15.8 percent in 1996, or 9.1 percent excluding the contribution of Parfac, consolidated since July 1995.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
